    "preamble": "Subhash Pillai vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 24 July, 2024 Author: Dinesh Kumar Paliwal Bench: Dinesh Kumar Paliwal 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Jabalpur Crr No. 2984 of 2024 (Subhash Pillai Vs The State Of Madhya Prade Dated : 24-07-2024 Shri Akhilendra Singh, G.A. for respondent/State. Trial court record has been received.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the applicant has submitted that he is an employee of Popular bread factory situated at Napier Town while the misbranded bread was manufactured in the popular bread factory situated at Adhartal. Learned counsel has challenged the legality, propriety and correctness of the judgments passed by the courts below. It is submitted that applicant is in jail for more than a month.",
